{"id":"609379","name":"小白菜水饺","author":"还在吃吃吃","authorId":"10106890","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/609379/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小油菜","amount":"4顆"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4枚"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"食盐","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"五香粉","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"香油","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小白菜叶子掰开清洗干净。","img":"images/609379/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成丝后在剁成末。","img":"images/609379/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"装入盆中加入食盐杀出水分。","img":"images/609379/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"胡萝卜擦细丝。","img":"images/609379/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"剁成末。","img":"images/609379/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"个鸡蛋打入碗中搅散。","img":"images/609379/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"准备葱花。","img":"images/609379/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"起锅烧油（用宽油，比平时炒菜多一些）。","img":"images/609379/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下入胡萝卜碎翻炒均匀倒入蛋液继续翻炒。","img":"images/609379/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将鸡蛋炒成颗粒状盛出备用。","img":"images/609379/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将小白菜末挤尽水分。","img":"images/609379/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"调馅：加入生抽1勺。","img":"images/609379/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"蚝油1勺。","img":"images/609379/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"五香粉半勺。","img":"images/609379/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"香油1勺搅拌均匀。","img":"images/609379/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"和面：将小白菜汁液倒入面粉中（使其全部的营养不流失）。","img":"images/609379/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"和好面团醒发半小时。","img":"images/609379/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"擀皮包入馅料。","img":"images/609379/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"包好的饺子。","img":"images/609379/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"水烧开下入锅中，中途浇一次凉水滚开即可。","img":"images/609379/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品图（尝一口，比肉馅的饺子好吃）。","img":"images/609379/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}